{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地股市個別發展。</p><p></p><p>四大指數均低開，除創業板指數外，三大指數收市回升。</p><p></p><p>機械人概念股上升，金融股延續升勢，工行及建行創新高，內房及存儲晶片股下跌，滬深兩市成交1.44萬億元人民幣，較上日減少1,179億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:20:01.802012+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T10:37:38.251653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:17:34.831113+00:00","content_hash":"dfc2d9c7ba5123ba3ec0e56d985972ac2836c8df80964089b04c202ff4b69798","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}